 and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia. On any other background, Axylo measures the palette against the resolved background and raises AX141 below 3:1. | Palette script scoring the rendered marks of an eight-series chart in both schemes, repeats included; rendered-pixel checks of separators; a grayscale screenshot in which three crossing lines can be told apart by marker | R7, WCAG 1.4.1, 1.4.11 |\n51e1be5:docs/02-product-spec.md:169:| AX130 | Warning | More than eight series | All series, with dash or marker differences |\n51e1be5:docs/02-product-spec.md:210:| C5 | When values were left out (F12), the description says so and a small marker with a text equivalent appears in the corner. | `dirty` fixture in compact mode |\n51e1be5:docs/02-product-spec.md:268:| One logical table, three input forms | D2. | Changed from \"one data shape\": typed columns and wide rows are first-class. |\n51e1be5:docs/02-product-spec.md:297:| Which keyboard and screen-reader pattern for the plot? | Decide from the M1 spike: three candidate patterns on the `trend` chart, rehearsed on the five pairs. | M1 record, confirmed in M4. |\ntotal 380\ndrwxrwxr-x   6 canarit canarit   4096 Nov 18 01:10 .\ndrwxrwxr-x   5 canarit canarit   4096 Nov 17 23:56 ..\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit     32 Nov 17 23:55 .gitignore\ndrwxrwxr-x   3 canarit canarit   4096 Nov 18 01:04 dist\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit    522 Nov 17 23:24 index.html\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit   1365 Nov 17 23:29 montage.mjs\ndrwxrwxr-x 142 canarit canarit   4096 Nov 17 23:27 node_modules\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit 143140 Nov 17 23:27 package-lock.json\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit   1151 Nov 17 23:27 package.json\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit   6246 Nov 18 01:04 palette.json\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit   4868 Nov 18 01:04 palette.mjs\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit   3446 Nov 17 23:42 perf.log\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit  14567 Nov 18 00:43 probe.mjs\n-rw-rw-r--   1 canarit canarit  17958 N